<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Growth too slow to reduce unemployment - Oppn.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Growth too slow to reduce unemployment - Oppn.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian opposition Treasury spokesman Gareth Evans said economic growth was still too slow to significantly reduce unemployment.</p>
<p>&quot;What they (the GDP figures) show is that the economy is growing no more than about two percent which is only half the rate necessary to make any significant impact on unemployment,&quot; Evans told reporters.</p>
</text>
